  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine how much older Jolyn is than Leon, we need to establish the age differences between each pair of classmates step by step.\n\n1. **Determine the age difference between Therese and Aivo:**\n   Therese is 5 months older than Aivo.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Age difference between Therese and Aivo} = 5 \\text{ months}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Determine the age difference between Jolyn and Therese:**\n   Jolyn is 2 months older than Therese.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Age difference between Jolyn and Therese} = 2 \\text{ months}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Determine the age difference between Jolyn and Aivo:**\n   Since Jolyn is 2 months older than Therese and Therese is 5 months older than Aivo, we can find the age difference between Jolyn and Aivo by adding the two age differences together.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Age difference between Jolyn and Aivo} = 2 \\text{ months} + 5 \\text{ months} = 7 \\text{ months}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Determine the age difference between Leon and Aivo:**\n   Leon is 2 months older than Aivo.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Age difference between Leon and Aivo} = 2 \\text{ months}\n   \\]\n\n5. **Determine the age difference between Jolyn and Leon:**\n   Since Jolyn is 7 months older than Aivo and Leon is 2 months older than Aivo, we can find the age difference between Jolyn and Leon by subtracting the age difference between Leon and Aivo from the age difference between Jolyn and Aivo.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Age difference between Jolyn and Leon} = 7 \\text{ months} - 2 \\text{ months} = 5 \\text{ months}\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, Jolyn is \\(\\boxed{5}\\) months older than Leon.",
